     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "Since the initialization value for <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">n</code> equals <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">4</code> and the value of <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">n</code> is only increasing, the loop condition will always remain true. The loop will never terminate."
